load/t_thumb/sc118ho.jpg"}, {"id": 1737277, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc118hp.jpg"}, {"id": 1737278, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc118hq.jpg"}, {"id": 1737279, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc118hr.jpg"}, {"id": 1737280, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc118hs.jpg"}], "slug": "room-713", "storyline": "You find yourself in the endless, looping corridors of a mysterious, liminal hotel. Spot anomalies to climb floors and reach your room... or be trapped forever.\n\nMay 1978. After a long drive through the night, you arrive at a lonely hotel. The lobby is empty, but someone has left a tape recorder on the reception counter. A single message plays:\n\n\u201cYour room is 713.\u201d", "summary": "Room 713 blends classic anomaly-spotting Exit 8-style gameplay with a murder mystery narrative. Pay close attention to your surroundings. Notice something wrong? Head left. Everything in order? Go right. With every correct choice, you climb a floor. Every mistake sends you back to the start.\n\nThe game features over 40 anomalies. Can you spot them all?", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/room-713", "videos": [{"id": 177282, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "lpXoiRgl7WI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lpXoiRgl7WI", "title": "ROOM 713 - Reveal Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lpXoiRgl7WI/fhddefault.jpg"}]}